1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,340
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:07,720
So tell me, gentlemen, what do
you think of my newest soldiers?

3
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,865
I'm sure there's no need
for any introductions.

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,290
That's enough!

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,694
Just drop the magic act and let's duel.

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,940
But we are dueling, you insensible twit.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,940
We're just doing it by
my rules, that's all.

8
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:24,117
Since I now control the
souls of your former friends,

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,577
I thought it would be fun to
let them play along with us.

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,760
All right.

11
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,340
This ends now.

12
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,900
How right you are.

13
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:36,440
I'm just about done once I play this card.

14
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,540
For the seal of Orichalcos is
about to become even stronger.

15
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,646
What are you up to, darkness?

16
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:47,800
And now, it's time to experience
the third level of darkness. Go!

17
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,600
Orichalcos Tritos!

18
00:01:56,620 --> 00:02:01,697
It's time to reinforce the Sacred Seal
with its most powerful lair thus far.

19
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:05,940
Behold the ancient magic
of my Orichalcos Tritos!

20
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:12,400
Welcome to level three, gentlemen.

21
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:16,589
How can the seal possibly
get any stronger?

22
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:20,157
We're dealing with the force
greater than the darkest shadows,

23
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,828
and older than time itself.

24
00:02:21,980 --> 00:02:23,804
Does that answer your question?

25
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,790
Whoa!

26
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:28,317
His life points are out of control!

27
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,740
Ori, Kalkos, Malevolence!

28
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:35,040
Use your special ability to switch
Kaiba's dragon into attack mode.

29
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:38,880
So I'm afraid this is goodbye.

30
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:41,660
With an attack strength of only 1,400,

31
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:44,977
your dragon is far too weak
to defend your lifeblocks.

32
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:46,760
So that means you lose.

33
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:50,500
Now, my beast, bring Kaiba's soul to me!

34
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:54,420
Raw, I activate my shrink card.

35
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:01,420
Is it beginning to sink in yet?

36
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,780
When used properly,

37
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:06,861
the seal of Aurichalcos is unmatched
by any other card in the game.

38
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:11,560
And due to its third layer, your magic
and trap cards are useless against me.

39
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,002
Darts is right.

40
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:15,877
Each layer of the seal is
more powerful than the last.

41
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:19,617
If we don't think of something soon,
Kaiba's going to lose the duel.

42
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:21,400
And worse, his soul.

43
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,557
As I was saying...

44
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:25,440
Aurichalcos Malevolent!

45
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:27,460
Destroy Kaiba's dragon!

46
00:03:29,860 --> 00:03:30,690
Zeto!

47
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,000
Hold on!

48
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,220
I play my Apple Shield card!

49
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:37,780
This allows me to sacrifice
Big Shield Gardener!

50
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:42,557
Then I can transfer every
one of its defense points

51
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:45,460
to Different Dimension
Dragon's attack points!

52
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:51,417
The Pharaoh sacrificed his
own monster to save Kaiba's!

53
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:53,580
Yeah, rich boy owes him big time!

54
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,497
Different Dimension Dragon!

55
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:56,410
Counter-attack!

56
00:03:56,493 --> 00:03:59,180
Crush his monster, now!

57
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:15,500
All the damage is absorbed by my Qtora!

58
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:19,240
No matter how powerful our monsters are,

59
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:23,000
his life points are safe as long
as his Qtora's on the field.

60
00:04:25,780 --> 00:04:28,537
is your dueling partner
really worth that much

61
00:04:28,620 --> 00:04:31,557
to you pharaoh because
you just gave up your only

62
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:35,357
defense to save him leaving
your life points wide

63
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:38,957
open to a direct attack as
a matter of fact you left

64
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:43,697
yourself open to four attacks
and i have the perfect

65
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:47,077
foursome in mind for the
job my mirror knights

66
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:51,477
known affectionately to
you as my pegasus yugi and

67
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:55,680
joey now strike down the
pharaoh my poor knights

68
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:10,617
how's it feel they're on my side now

69
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:15,160
one more left i save the best for last

70
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:22,300
Yugi boy, please tell me you
have the card I gave you.

71
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:28,680
You're our only hope, so I've created an
exclusive card just for you, Yugi boy.

72
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:32,320
No, real special card.

73
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,020
This thing's completely blank, guys.

74
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:36,476
Then it's worthless.

75
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,220
Not necessarily.

76
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:42,277
That card unlocks the secret
of the legendary dragons.

77
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:45,660
What are you waiting for? Attack him!

78
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,340
This is bad.

79
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:52,320
Get back up.

80
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,860
Let's go.

81
00:05:54,940 --> 00:05:56,077
I'll be fine.

82
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,340
Thanks for asking.

83
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:03,416
Our life points are decreasing, while
darts continues to grow stronger.

84
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:08,671
Now, what did Pegasus mean by unlocking
the secret of the legendary dragons?

85
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:12,277
Could the card he gave me be
the secret to defeating darts?

86
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,478
And saving mankind?

87
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:18,840
I think I'll place one card face
down and end my turn for now.

88
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,900
All right, Kyber.

89
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:23,080
Go ahead and make your final move.

90
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:27,160
For with only 600 points left,
your time is just about up.

91
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:37,097
I hate to admit it, but if I don't think
of something quick, Darts is gonna win.

92
00:06:37,180 --> 00:06:38,840
And I can't let that happen.

93
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:42,560
Not after everything that
lunatic's put me through.

94
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:49,620
I'll never see my brother again, because
your father took him away from me.

95
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:55,620
Of course, what Alistair doesn't know is
that Kaiba's father didn't do a thing.

96
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:58,060
That honor belongs to me.

97
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:03,417
Convincing Alistair that my family
ruined his life was one thing.

98
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:06,957
But when Darts bought out my
company, he crossed the line.

99
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:10,216
And there's no way I'm letting
him get away with that.

100
00:07:10,300 --> 00:07:13,037
You may have pushed around
your little cronies,

101
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:15,760
but I refuse to end up like they did.

102
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,880
So I play this.

103
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:29,004
Guess I should have warned you.

104
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:32,660
Whenever I'm about to lose,
I draw exactly what I need.

105
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:35,760
And this time's no different.

106
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,480
It's Critias!

107
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:48,980
Now, if I know your gaming
strategies as well as I think I do,

108
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:53,777
then I'd have to say the face-down card you
played before is your Mirror Force Trap.

109
00:07:53,860 --> 00:07:54,690
That's right.

110
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,860
I reveal Yugi's Trap card!

111
00:07:57,800 --> 00:08:01,860
Finally, I'll merge the Fang
of Critias with Mirror Force!

112
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:15,060
Now rise!

113
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,520
Mirror Force Dragon!

114
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:24,500
What do you plan to attack? Come on,

115
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:27,057
you know as well as I do
that there's no way we can

116
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:30,237
win as long as he's got those
four knights on the field!

117
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,150
Kaiba, no!

118
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:34,557
They're just monster
holograms, so get over it!

119
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:38,875
Darts made him look like your lame
friend, so you'd be afraid to attack.

120
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:40,200
Well, allow me.

121
00:08:41,900 --> 00:08:45,420
Mirror Force Dragon, attack
his Pegasus Knight now!

122
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:52,820
That's weird.

123
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:55,217
Why would Kaiba attack
the one that had a shield?

124
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:59,040
Trust me, Zeta wanted that knight
to reflect his attack, guys.

125
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:02,360
Why the long face?

126
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:06,234
Could it be you're aware of
my dragon's special ability?

127
00:09:06,620 --> 00:09:08,460
Go absorb reflection!

128
00:09:11,260 --> 00:09:13,436
I guess Kaiba knew what he was doing.

129
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:14,977
What did I tell you?

130
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:16,884
My brother's always got a plan.

131
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:24,717
Time to use the power I just
absorbed by reflecting the blast

132
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:28,757
back to your side and taking out
all four of your knights. So do it!

133
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:32,960
Hold on, if they get hit,
are their souls lost forever?

134
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:39,157
We're about to find out Don't think I'm
as gullible as the rest of these dorks

135
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:44,840
You can't scare me with a couple of
reprogrammed holograms Don't you know who I am?

136
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:49,077
I invented this technology And
I know how you manipulated the

137
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:53,940
images to resemble those four
losers So you can drop the act darts

138
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:58,060
Mirror Force Dragon,
flatten those phonies now

139
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:05,160
Absorb Reflection!

140
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:06,820
Activate!

141
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:10,960
Relax!

142
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:18,890
Yugi!

143
00:10:18,973 --> 00:10:19,861
Are you alright?

144
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:23,080
We're fine!

145
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,620
But how?

146
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:28,400
Oh, Kaiba boy, you did it.

147
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,040
They're gone.

148
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,620
Very impressive, Kaiba.

149
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,780
But I'll be just fine.

150
00:10:39,140 --> 00:10:41,800
After all, my life points
are still unharmed.

151
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:44,877
You see, even though it's
about to be destroyed,

152
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:49,700
my Qtora is able to absorb all the
damage before saying its final goodbyes.

153
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,717
At least my friends are safe.

154
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:55,460
Thanks to my dragon, you have
no monsters to protect you.

155
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:57,200
Well, I beg to differ.

156
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,400
Take a closer look, won't you?

157
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:06,580
Eutora has another ability.

158
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:09,600
Whenever it's destroyed, it evolves.

159
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,100
Oh, no.

160
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:22,741
What's going on?

161
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:29,520
What is that?

162
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:33,440
My little friend is all
grown up, so playtime's over.

163
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:43,140
Gentlemen, I'd like you to
meet Ori Calco Shunaros.

164
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:46,040
You see what I see? Unfortunately.

165
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:47,650
See what?

166
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:49,877
That thing's got 20,000 points.

167
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,780
Don't look so surprised.

168
00:11:52,220 --> 00:11:55,117
You're the ones who created
this unstoppable beast!

169
00:11:55,200 --> 00:12:00,220
You may have destroyed my previous monsters,
but you unleashed something far worse.

170
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:03,080
It can wipe us out in one strike!

171
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:08,064
You're absolutely right, but before I do
that, I have some more bad news to share.

172
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:11,480
Orichalcos Shunaros, activate
your special ability!

173
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:14,220
Release Orichalcos Dexia!

174
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,880
And Orichalcos Anisteros!

175
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,268
What's the meaning of this?

176
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,920
Allow me to clear things up.

177
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:25,957
Shunaros just released two more creatures.

178
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,897
The first one is known as Dexia,

179
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:32,197
and its attack strength is always 300 points
higher than the monster it's battling,

180
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,927
making it the perfect sword.

181
00:12:36,940 --> 00:12:39,380
And the second one is just as strong.

182
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:42,697
It will intercept every one
of your attacks and retaliate

183
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:45,957
with a blast that's 300 points
greater than the one you fired,

184
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:49,180
making Orycalcos Aristeros
the perfect shield.

185
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:54,980
You'll never get past my triple threat.

186
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:02,632
Not only is his monster more
powerful than Kaiba's dragon,

187
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:07,682
but with Dexia and Aristeros on the front
line, our attacks won't even get through.

188
00:13:09,580 --> 00:13:12,537
I activate the trap card Martyr Curse.

189
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:17,420
This force is one of your monsters to
engage in a battle with one of my monsters.

190
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:19,597
And as a nasty little side effect,

191
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:23,037
it cancels out any special
abilities your creature may have.

192
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:25,944
And since I don't seem
to have much of a choice,

193
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,580
I'll target your Mirror Force Dragon!

194
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:33,140
Without its reflecting power, your
dragon's completely defenseless.

195
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:36,340
Which means you're about
to be out-won souls.

196
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,580
Orichalcosuneros!

197
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:43,900
Remove Kyber's life points so the
Orichalcos can remove his spirit!

198
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,740
Photon ring blast!

199
00:13:56,180 --> 00:13:57,920
Ta-ta, Kyber!

200
00:13:58,280 --> 00:14:00,760
We can't keep the great Leviathan waiting!

201
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:02,240
Kyber, no!

202
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:14,580
Ori Kalkos 1, Seto Kaiba, zip.

203
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:17,917
No!

204
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:21,080
Kaiba, are you all right? Kaiba!

205
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,880
I'm not done.

206
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,100
Activate! Trap!

207
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:36,880
It's called Wish, a final effort.

208
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:42,400
It converts every one of my dragon's
attack points into your life points, Yugi.

209
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,240
Kaiba, wait!

210
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:50,460
Hang on!

211
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,720
Echo, come on!

212
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:54,980
Come on, wake up!

213
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:56,240
Say something!

214
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:58,780
Don't screw up. Got it?

215
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:03,640
I fought too hard, so you
can't lose this. Now win!

216
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:05,680
I will.

217
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,180
I promise.

218
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:12,420
Farrow, it looks like
you're the sole survivor.

219
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,917
You disgust me.

220
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,540
I'll tell you what.

221
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:30,060
Since I already have what I need,
you can keep the rest of him.

222
00:15:31,780 --> 00:15:32,610
Kaiba!

223
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:34,900
Oh, man.

224
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,580
Come on, bro.

225
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,480
Please open your eyes.

226
00:15:38,860 --> 00:15:40,801
I know you're in there somewhere.

227
00:15:41,340 --> 00:15:43,281
On the contrary, my young friend.

228
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:45,997
I'm afraid you're talking
to an empty shell.

229
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:49,737
Your brother has graciously donated
his life force to the Great Beast.

230
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:51,940
No, it's not Pear.

231
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:53,540
Give him back, darts!

232
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:03,160
What's going on?

233
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:29,340
Do you hear that? Thanks to Mr.

234
00:16:29,500 --> 00:16:34,060
Kaiba's generous donation, the
great Leviathan is almost ready. No!

235
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:38,177
Tell your stupid lizard to spit out
my brother before I force him to!

236
00:16:38,260 --> 00:16:39,090
Silence!

237
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,680
What have you done to them?

238
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,120
Are you all right?

239
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:53,280
Teya? Tristan? Mokuba?

240
00:16:57,580 --> 00:16:59,920
Poor Pharaoh, you're all alone now.

241
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:07,555
Don't worry, Pharaoh.

242
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:08,957
Your friends are fine.

243
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,452
I don't need weak souls.

244
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:14,417
I just wanted to spend some
quality time with you one-on-one.

245
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:15,540
Is that so wrong?

246
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,900
That's enough!

247
00:17:17,300 --> 00:17:20,077
But there's something I
think you'll want to know.

248
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:23,660
You and I met 5,000 years ago
when you were king of Egypt.

249
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:29,080
We may not have been officially introduced,
but I was there watching you. Go on.

250
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:33,857
When the Battle of Atlantis ended, I thought
the Great Leviathan was gone forever.

251
00:17:33,940 --> 00:17:36,760
